{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat TASK.md && cat AGENTS.md && cat package.json'","aggregated_output":"# Assigned development task\r\n\r\nAdd a labelled native dropdown status filter to the authenticated payment history page. Offer All statuses, Pending, Paid (stored as completed), Cancelled and Expired. Apply the chosen filter through a GET submission using the `status` query parameter. Reloading or opening that URL must preserve the selected option and displayed results. Selecting All statuses must restore the complete history for the current user.\r\n\r\nAccept exactly pending/completed/cancelled/expired. Missing, empty, invalid or repeated status parameters fall back to All statuses. If a valid filter has no matches, show a clear empty-result message while retaining the filter and an accessible way to return to all orders.\r\n\r\nPreserve authentication, ownership restrictions, descending creation-time ordering, and existing order information. Viewing/filtering must not alter stored orders or change the status API or cancellation behavior. Multiple correct implementations are allowed; no required file list, query method, component structure or patch is part of the task contract.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Local environment\r\nDependencies are installed. A fresh local test database is migrated and seeded. A Next development server is running at http://localhost:3107. Test accounts are listed by scripts/seed.ts. No real payment or email service is configured.\r\n\r\nAvailable supplied checks: pnpm check-types; pnpm test:run; pnpm build. You may write and run your own checks. Keep changes in this workspace and do not commit them. The same 15-minute wall-time limit applies to every condition. Finish with a short account of your changes and checks.\r\n# SmartKit qualification snapshot\r\n\r\nNext.js App Router paths remain under src/app. Keep existing authentication,\r\nownership predicates, billing state semantics, and server/client boundaries.\r\nClient components use 'use client'; server-only modules retain server-only imports.\r\nShare validation schemas between callers. Revalidate affected routes after writes.\r\nKeep the supplied layout when extending code. Resolve imports through @/.\r\nTests remain centralized under src/tests with the same test cases in both layouts.\r\nRun pnpm check-types, pnpm test:run and pnpm build for relevant changes.\r\n\r\n## Layout\r\nApplication modules are grouped by technical role under src/components, src/hooks, src/actions, src/types, src/lib, src/emails and src/services. Within each role, use domain subdirectories; domain entry points and processing modules live under services.\r\n\r\n## Development pilot\r\nRead TASK.md for the assigned requirement and available check commands. Preserve application behavior outside the requested change.\r\n{\r\n  \"name\": \"smartkit\",\r\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\r\n  \"private\": true,\r\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@11.7.0\",\r\n  \"engines\": {\r\n    \"node\": \">=22.0.0\",\r\n    \"pnpm\": \">=10.0.0\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"scripts\": {\r\n    \"dev\": \"next dev\",\r\n    \"build\": \"next build\",\r\n    \"start\": \"next start\",\r\n    \"lint\": \"biome check .\",\r\n    \"lint:fix\": \"biome check --write .\",\r\n    \"format\": \"biome format --write .\",\r\n    \"check-types\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\r\n    \"test\": \"vitest\",\r\n    \"test:ui\": \"vitest --ui\",\r\n    \"test:coverage\": \"vitest --coverage\",\r\n    \"test:run\": \"vitest run\",\r\n    \"db:generate\": \"drizzle-kit generate\",\r\n    \"db:migrate\": \"drizzle-kit migrate\",\r\n    \"db:studio\": \"drizzle-kit studio\",\r\n    \"db:push\": \"drizzle-kit push\",\r\n    \"db:backfill-journal\": \"tsx scripts/backfill-drizzle-journal.ts\",\r\n    \"db:seed\": \"tsx scripts/seed.ts\",\r\n    \"pretest:billing\": \"tsx scripts/ensure-server-only-shim.ts\",\r\n    \"test:billing\": \"tsx scripts/test-billing-scenarios.ts\",\r\n    \"test:sepay\": \"tsx scripts/test-sepay.ts\",\r\n    \"test:sepay-qr-url\": \"tsx scripts/test-sepay-qr-url.ts\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"dependencies\": {\r\n    \"bcryptjs\": \"^3.0.3\",\r\n    \"better-auth\": \"^1.6.25\",\r\n    \"clsx\": \"^2.1.1\",\r\n    \"dotenv\": \"^17.4.2\",\r\n    \"drizzle-kit\": \"^0.31.10\",\r\n    \"drizzle-orm\": \"^0.45.2\",\r\n    \"lucide-react\": \"^1.31.0\",\r\n    \"nanoid\": \"^6.0.0\",\r\n    \"next\": \"16.2.12\",\r\n    \"next-themes\": \"^0.4.6\",\r\n    \"pg\": \"^8.22.0\",\r\n    \"react\": \"18.3.1\",\r\n    \"react-dom\": \"18.3.1\",\r\n    \"react-email\": \"6.9.1\",\r\n    \"resend\": \"^6.18.1\",\r\n    \"tailwind-merge\": \"^3.6.0\",\r\n    \"zod\": \"^4.4.3\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"devDependencies\": {\r\n    \"@better-auth/drizzle-adapter\": \"^1.6.25\",\r\n    \"@biomejs/biome\": \"2.5.6\",\r\n    \"@tailwindcss/postcss\": \"^4.3.3\",\r\n    \"@testing-library/jest-dom\": \"^7.0.1\",\r\n    \"@testing-library/react\": \"^16.3.2\",\r\n    \"@testing-library/user-event\": \"^14.6.6\",\r\n    \"@types/bcryptjs\": \"^3.0.0\",\r\n    \"@types/node\": \"^26\",\r\n    \"@types/pg\": \"^8.20.0\",\r\n    \"@types/react\": \"^18.3.1\",\r\n    \"@types/react-dom\": \"^18.3.1\",\r\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"^6.1.0\",\r\n    \"@vitest/ui\": \"^4.1.11\",\r\n    \"happy-dom\": \"^20.11.8\",\r\n    \"jsdom\": \"^30.0.1\",\r\n    \"tailwindcss\": \"^4.3.3\",\r\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.22.4\",\r\n    \"typescript\": \"5.7.3\",\r\n    \"vitest\": \"^4.1.11\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
